window.products.push({"id":561012,"name":"Mason Jar Vacuum Sealer Kit, Electric Food Jar Sealer For Food Storage, 6-in-1 Handheld Vacuum Pump Kit Accessories Fits Wide and Regular Mouth Mason ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61sRM15cShL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【6 in 1 Mason Jar Vacuum Sealer】Our 6 in 1 electric vacuum sealer kit include 1x Handheld vacuum pump ( with lifebuoy air nozzle, balloon nozzle, air pump needle on the back), 1 x Wide Mouth Sealer, 1 x Regular Mouth Sealer, 1 x Lid Opener, 1 x Type C Cable, 3 x Wide Mouth Mason Jar Lids(86mm), 3 x Regular Mouth Mason Jar Lids(70mm). 【Electric Portable Vacuum Pump】No vacuum sealer machine when you go out? or the sealer is too big to carry with you when you travel or outdoor picnic? Don't worry!! We offer you an electric pump that you can use to pump air out of the mason jars. you can easily use the electric air pump to seal the jars to store food even when out cooking, picnicking or camping. 【Keep Food Freshness & Safe】This food saver jar sealer is made of premium ABS plastic, food-grade silicone, BPA-free, non-toxic and odorless, Easy to clean by hand or in the dishwasher. Sealer creates an airtight vacuum seal on the jar lid to keep food fresh and prevent odors and moisture. The jar sealer is best choice for the safe storage of foods. 【Easy to Use】The food vacuum sealers is very easy to use, just cover this can vacuum sealing kit on the wide mouth or regular mouth mason jars, make sure the electric canning jars sealer is centred and pressed firmly against the lid of the jar, click the button to start the vacuum pump for 10s or more and the air can be evacuated to the seal. Clicking the button again closes the sealer. One-button switch, easy to use. 【Meet All Your Vacuum Seal Needs】Our handheld vacuum sealer can vacuum zipper bags、food storage containers and mason jars,keep food delicious. It can also inflate balloons, life buoys, basketball, football, etc. Meet all your needs. 【100% Satisfied Service】If you have any questions about our mason jars vacuum sealer, or it does not meet your expectations after you purchased, please contact us immediately, we will provide you with satisfactory service within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61sRM15cShL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MEKOLIFE","source_asin":"B0BQ62Y9S3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-561012","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQ62Y9S3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQ62Y9S3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
