window.products.push({"id":561017,"name":"MASTERTOP Mandoline Slicer for Kitchen Adjustable Stainless Steel Food Slicer Vegetable Chopper Onion Waffle French Fry Cutter Potato Chip Julienne Sl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":31.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81X1ED+NlzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Adjustable Mandoline Slicer: We designed three kinds of thickness slicing blades-3mm, 6mm and 9mm; two julienne settings-4.5mm and 9mm. With built-in rotating adjustable blade, if need to adjust thickness or change cutting options, just adjust knob, no need to touch the blade. Versatile and Practical: The vegetable slicer can easily cut vegetables into slices or strips. Perfect for potatoes, cucumbers, zucchini, carrots, apples and onions, etc. The smaller knob also can rotate and switch the blade, the corrugated blade can make waffle fries or ruffled potato chips. Durable and Safe: The vegetable cutter is made of high quality stainless steel with sharp edge and hard texture. The pusher protect your hands from damaged. The anti-slip handle and feet can improve the stability during use and reduce the risk of finger injury. Please wear the resistant gloves when using it. Save Space: The blades are built-in and does not require extra space for storage. The support handle and anti-slip feet are foldable, making it comfortable to use and easy to fold and store. The slicer can be folded into a flat form for easy storage in a drawer. Easy to Clean: Press the button next to the vegetable cutter and turn to \"OUT\" to easily remove the drum. Pull out the blade on the side easily, and then directly rinse the vegetable cutter with water. The complimentary brush can also clean up the food residue left on the slicer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81X1ED+NlzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MASTERTOP","source_asin":"B0B2R8QJYF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-561017","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B2R8QJYF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B2R8QJYF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":561018,"name":"ArtWall 3-Piece Starry Night by Vincent Van Gogh Gallery Wrapped Canvas Artwork, 36 by 54-Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91yci39Ef6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Art Wall's \"Starry Night\" by Vincent van Gogh Canvas Art. Starry Night by Vincent van Gogh has risen to the peak of artistic achievements. Starry Night is one of the most well known images in modern culture as well as being one of the most replicated and sought after prints. There are actually several main aspects that intrigue those who view this image and each factor affects each individual differently: 1. There is the night sky filled with swirling clouds, stars ablaze with their own luminescence and a bright crescent moon. Although the features are exaggerated, this is a scene we can all relate to and also one that most individuals feel comfortable and at ease with. This sky keeps the viewer's eyes moving about the painting, following the curves and creating a visual dot to dot with the stars. This movement keeps the onlooker involved in the painting while the other factors take hold. 2. Below the rolling hills of the horizon lies a small town. There is a peaceful essence flowing from the structures. Perhaps the cool dark colors and the fiery windows spark memories of our own warm childhood years filled with imagination of what exists in the night and dark starry skies. The center point of the town is the tall steeple of the church, reigning largely over the smaller buildings. This steeple casts down a sense of stability onto the town and also creates a sense of size and seclusion. 3. To the left of the painting there is a massive dark structure that develops an even greater sense of size and isolation. This structure is magnificent when compared to the scale of other objects in the painting. The curving lines mirror that of the sky and create the sensation of depth in the painting. This structure also allows the viewer to interpret what it is. From a mountain to a leafy bush, the analysis of this formation is wide and full of variety.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91yci39Ef6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ArtWall","source_asin":"B00CO77Q54","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-561018","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00CO77Q54","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00CO77Q54","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
