window.products.push({"id":561069,"name":"Column Vases Wedding Centerpieces for Tables - 2 Pcs Metal Flower Stand, Inweder Gold Tall Floor Vase, 31.5in Rectangular Geometric Flower Rack for We","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":50.85,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KwYtUtHNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Classic and Stable Cube Design: Inweder gold centerpieces for table adopts the classic columnar cube shape design, which is simple and elegant. You can put bouquets and other decorations on the flower stand to add romance and luxury to your wedding and event. At the same time, the columnar design can also improve the stability of the gold column flower vase. Even if you put a lot of decorations on the column flower vase, it will not fall down easily. High-Quality and Multi Sizes: The gold vases for centerpieces are made of high-quality nickel-plated materials through multiple processes such as die-casting, electroplating, and polishing. Its surface is smooth and shiny. It is also anti-rust and anti-corrosion, and can be used many times and for a long time. In addition, we provide metal flower stands in 3 sizes(15.75inches/23.6 inches/31.5 inches) and 2 colors(Gold/White) for your different needs. Easy to Assemble and Disassemble: No tools required. Inweder wedding metal flower stand can be quickly installed in a couple of minutes. You only need to insert 8 metal strips into 2 square metal bases, it's very easy. And if you have any problems with the installation, please contact us, we will help you solve it immediately. Besides, they come apart which makes for easy transport and storage. Perfect for Many Occasions: The geometric gold flower stand is elegant and luxurious, which makes it an ideal decoration for weddings, table centerpieces, road signs, birthday parties, anniversaries, and ceremonies. At the same time, it can also be used for decoration of daily occasions, such as living room, bedroom, fireplace, office, or formal dining room, etc. And you can also place different decorations on the vase stand according to different occasions or themes. Fast Delivery & 100% Satisfaction: Fast delivery service by Amazon, delivered in time for your event. Inweder always specialized in designing high-quality and elegant Wedding and Home Decorations since 1999. If you have any dissatisfaction or questions about the product, please contact us, we will give you a satisfactory solution within 12 hours. Sincerely wish you a nice event!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KwYtUtHNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Inweder","source_asin":"B09MPZG6J9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-561069","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MPZG6J9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MPZG6J9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
