window.products.push({"id":561202,"name":"SKINNYBUNNY 20 Inch Wall Mounted Fan, High Velocity 3 Speed for Industrial, Commercial, Residential, and Greenhouse Use, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yadSlewTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Metal Wall Mount Fan - This 20 Inches tilt-around fan from is ideal for industrial, commercial, residential, shop use, patio, backyard or even warehouse and factory stations and it tilts a full 360 degrees made out of powder coated steel construction and premium ball bearing motors. Design - Corrosion resistant steel fan head structure offered in a black finish, includes wall mounting bracket and features a 20-inch diameter 3-aluminum paddle blades attached to a steel hub and spider assembly for high velocity performance. The 3-speed motor comes with 1/4 horsepower, permanently lubricated, ball bearing, open ventilated motor with permanent split capacitor generating 2.4-amps at 120V, single phase electrical service; UL and C/UL Listed. Air Delivery - High: 4650. Medium: 4000. Low: 3500. With a heavy duty 3-speed thermally protected PSC motor making it the most powerful metal wall mount fan on the market. It came with Newest Technology of Dual Ball Bearing while most of the other competitors on the market are using Sleeve Bearing. Adjustable Tilting - Equipped with a versatile adjustable tilt, this metal wall mounted patio fan let you customize the airflow more flexiable, no matter where it’s needed. Two tough knobs lock the air blowing direction you expect. Ideal for locations where floor space is limited or when overhead circulation is required. Easy to Assemble & Use - With new frustration free packaging, hang top-rated high velocity fan from the wall or the ceiling by using our bracket only takes you a second. Sturdy metal frame is also easy to clean. Loosen the knob and adjust the tilt of the fan head to get air to blow exactly where you need it most.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yadSlewTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SKINNYBUNNY","source_asin":"B0BLH5GDM7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-561202","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLH5GDM7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLH5GDM7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
