window.products.push({"id":561242,"name":"ZIEIS 3000g x 0.1g High Precision Digital Kitchen Scale, Z3000-Surge-3Q, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ayet0DohL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Your ZIEIS multi-purpose digital scale is perfect for the kitchen, office, or any weighing application. Your scale offers a capacity of 3000 grams (6.6 Lb) and an accuracy of 0.1g (0.005oz). In addition, it also includes a 3 Quart Stainless Steel Bowl. These highly polished bowls are perfect for many different weighing tasks including portion control, mixing, hobbies, and much more. Your scale features FIVE (5) weighing modes: Pounds/Ounces (lb/oz), Pounds (lb), Ounces (oz), Kilograms (kg), Grams (g) that provide you with the weighing options you need. Also includes TARE/ZERO, which subtracts the container's weight to obtain the content's weight. Rubberized feet will help secure unit from movement and absorb vibrations. Low battery indicator ensures proper power for consistent accuracy. Your ZIEIS scale includes Programmable Power that allows you to set your digital scale to automatically turn off after a few minutes of non-use or you can program the scale to always stay on until you turn it off. You select the power setting the works best for your application. AC/DC power for both portable (6 x AA) and reliable power options (includes 110V adapter). This series also features Z-Seal Plus, which prevents damage to LCD and buttons caused by spillage. In addition, your scale includes an 110V power adapter and ZIEIS Surge Protector, which is essential for protecting your scale from disastrous electrical problems such as spikes & surges. ZIEIS Professional Series digital scales are also manufactured under ISO 9001-2000 Manufacturers Certification to ensure exception quality and reliability. ZIEIS Professional Series digital scales include a TEN (10) year NEW SCALE warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ayet0DohL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZIEIS","source_asin":"B008FPQAHO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-561242","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008FPQAHO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008FPQAHO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":561243,"name":"Creswick Australian Mills Hobart Machine Washable Blanket, Twin, Hazel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81JN2r3GurL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cheswick Hobart Australian Wool Blend Twin Size Blanket - Wool is known as Natures Best Insulator and High Performance Fabric. The wool comes from the Sheep of Australia who are regarded as having the finest and softest wool of any sheep in the world. Because Australian Wool fibbers are smaller in diameter and more numerous than coarser wools, it makes it one of the softest, most durable and dense types of wool available. It is also naturally itch free. The benefits of the Hobart Wool Blend blanket is that it has an amazing warmth-to-weight ratio making it a perfect temperature regulating blanket that will keep you warmer in the winter months and cooler in the summer. The Wool fibbers naturally absorb and wick moisture (sweat) away from the skin keeping you drier and more comfortable. The wool fibbers do not retain odor because bacteria cannot find a solid surface to grow on. Australian wool naturally contains lanolin, which has properties, thus making it as well. It is also hypo-allergenic, as is most wool. Our blankets are designed at Creswick Woollen Mills in Australia, which was Founded in 1947 and still operating today. The Hobart Blanket is manufactured using 70-percent recycled Australian Wool and 30-percent Polyester. The wool is recycled from offcuts and textile surplus from blanket production. This process makes the Brisbane blankets extremely durable and gives them their unique colours, textures and feel. This luxurious twin size blanket measures an oversized 72-inch by 90-Inch. A contrasting colour Whipstitch hem is added to create a clean crisp edge and give visual interest. Care instructions: Machine wash cold with wool detergent.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81JN2r3GurL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Creswick Australian Mills","source_asin":"B00G8Y0OV2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-561243","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00G8Y0OV2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00G8Y0OV2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
