window.products.push({"id":561246,"name":"PINK HAPPY BIRTHDAY BANNER DECORATIONS SET - Pink and Gold Birthday Party Decorations | Pink Gold snd White Theme Balloon | Party Supplies for Princes","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611AW0F4MhL._AC_SL1083_.jpg","description":"Our team of party planners has hand-selected the most popular Birthday Balloons and Decorations so that you can decorate with ease, suitable for any age Quality: 1). The Happy Birthday Sign is Reusable thanks to its sturdy cardstock material 2). The Mylar Star Balloons are made using MicroSealing technology for better, stronger and longer lasting seal with a seamless beautiful appearance 3). Never hear any Balloons Popping sound again while blowing them as our Latex Balloons are made of 3.2g material which is highest in standard. Size: 1). For Better Fexibity and easy use, We include 2 separate strands measuring 3M and 6M. The phrase \"HAPPY BIRTHDAY\"is spelled on each 13 Pennants measuring 8 x 6 inch 2). 18 Inchs Star Balloon- , Its Size makes it float when filled with helium, alternately it can be filled with AIR using pump or straw., for easy of use Our Star Foil Balloon has tabs, they come 4 ct. 2 Gold, 2 Pink Color 3). 12 Inchs Latex Balloons Helium Quality can be filled with AIR or Helium, it will come in 3 colors, 9 each; Gold, White and Pink., total 27 pcs PRINTABLE PARTY PLANNER & CHECKLIST: 1). Printable Birthday Planner is simple,and ready-to-print high-quality party planner that will help keep you organized for your party 2). Please Note Printable Planner is not a physical item.they are high-quality PDF file and will be sent on your amazon registered email soon after your order is confirmed. Pintables are designed by our staff and are for personal use only Click Add to Cart and make your party memorable with our Birthday Balloons and Decoration HAPPY PLANNING!!!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611AW0F4MhL._AC_SL1083_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KatchOn","source_asin":"B01M5EZK7I","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-561246","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M5EZK7I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M5EZK7I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
