window.products.push({"id":561454,"name":"Chefman Choice Cut Electric Meat Grinder 3 Stainless Steel Grinding Plates for Fine Medium & Coarse, Sausage Stuffing Attachment, Make Custom Hamburge","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51zBzF6XbgL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Gone are the days where the only place for meat grinders was behind the counter at your local butcher shop. Grinding meat at home not only allows you to control exactly what goes into your food, but it also allows you to choose the perfect grind for specific recipes. Looking to make chorizo? Use the 7mm plate. Want a chunky burger that’s half beef, half pork? Use the 5mm plate. Want a thinner patty? Use the 3mm plate. With the Chefman Choice Cut Electric Meat Grinder, you can grind meat for everything from meatballs to specialty sausages. The flavor will be fresher, and you’ll save money by buying in bulk and grinding your favorite mixes yourself. Depending on what you’re making, season the meat with fresh herbs and spices before grinding for extra tasty results. Have leftover bread that’s going stale? You can even use this grinder to make homemade breadcrumbs. The Chefman Choice Cut Electric Meat Grinder has a heavy-duty 550-watt motor that grinds about 2.6 lbs of meat per minute; plus, a sleek, compact design—and not to mention bragging rights next time you see your butcher. Whether you’re new to meat grinding, it’s a hobby of yours, or you’re a meat connoisseur, we know you’ll love using this meat grinder. Great cooking starts long before the food hits the flame, so be sure to read this User Guide before you get started.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51zBzF6XbgL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chefman","source_asin":"B07VBPLXYH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-561454","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VBPLXYH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VBPLXYH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
