window.products.push({"id":561576,"name":"Contigo AUTOSEAL Aria Vacuum Insulated Stainless Steel Travel Mug, 16oz, Stainless Steel with Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tc4jxLnpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Contigo AUTOSEAL Aria Stainless Steel Travel Mug 10, 16, and 20-ounce Capacities These double-wall vacuum-insulated travel mugs feature the patented AUTOSEAL lid, making them leak and spill proof, yet easy to use and hold. An added button lock provides even more security, by preventing accidental pressing of the AUTOSEAL button while on-the-go. The mugs fit most car cup-holders and the 10-ounce Aria fits most single-serve brewers. Aria travel mugs are top-rack dishwasher safe for fast and convenient cleaning. Contigo AUTOSEAL Aria Stainless Steel Travel Bottle Features: •  16-ounce stainless steel travel mug in [color] for both hot and cold beverages •  Patented AUTOSEAL lid automatically seals between sips to protect against leaks and spills •  Convenient one-handed drinking for both left and right-handed drinkers •  Vacuum-insulated stainless steel keeps beverages hot for 4 hours and cold for 12 hours •  Unique flow-control spout allows the user to better control the rate of flow while enjoying the beverage’s aroma •  Button lock prevents accidental pressing of button for added security while on-the-go •  Top-rack dishwasher-safe lid hinges open for easy cleaning •  Fits most standard car cup holders •  Fits most single-serve brewers AUTOSEAL Technology Automatically seals between sips The leak and spill proof AUTOSEAL lid automatically seals between sips, preventing leaks and spills. There is no cap to remove or spout to open, so it is great for one-handed, on-the-go drinking whether commuting, hiking, or just dealing with a busy day. Simply press the button to drink and then release to seal between sips. And because the lid system is always closed unless activated, your beverages will remain hotter or colder for longer periods of time. Double Wall Vacuum-insulation For maximum temperature retention Made from durable stainless steel, the mug has a vacuum-insulated double wall, ensuring that hot beverages stay hot and cool beverages stay cool. The 16-ounce mug’s vacuum-insulation keeps beverages hot for up to 5 hours and cold for up to 14 hours. The larger 20-ounce size offers 7 hour heat retention and keeps cold beverages cold for up to 20 hours. The 10-ounce mug keeps beverages hot for 3 hours and cold for 9 hours. The double-wall construction not only retains temperature, but also prevents external condensation from forming so table tops remain free from moisture. Easy Slide-lock Feature Prevents accidental pressing of button An added button-lock feature provides even more on-the-go security, by preventing any unintended pressing of the button. You’ll have extra confidence as you go about your daily routine, knowing your drink is fully sealed inside. Environmentally friendly By using this Contigo product, you're both helping the environment and also saving money by taking your coffee, tea, water or juice with you in a reusable container instead of buying cups or water bottles as you go. Research shows that coffee drinkers can save nearly 23 pounds of paper cup waste by toting around their own reusable mug. Caring for Your Contigo For easy care, the Contigo Aria lid and body are both top-rack dishwasher safe. Always rinse the mug immediately after each use, and always store the mug with its lid removed to prevent moisture from becoming trapped in the body or lid after washing. Do not keep liquids that spoil easily, such as dairy, in the mug for prolonged periods. For use with hot or cold beverages. About Contigo Knowing that on-the-go beverages can be messy and complicated to use, Contigo developed a line of simple, yet functionally innovative drinkware to help people face life's daily challenges. The products are stylish yet resilient; sleek yet strong – the perfect combination of performance and grace. Contigo products give you the confidence you need to face the day, and pride in knowing that you bought the best of the best. Contigo is passionate about the products they create and believes you will be pleasantly surprised by the array of helpful innovations it offers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tc4jxLnpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Contigo","source_asin":"B004XXK3F2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-561576","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004XXK3F2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004XXK3F2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":561577,"name":"Firstofakind Barn Candle Lantern - 7.5 Inch Tealight Holder Lantern, Vintage Style Candle Lanterns - Decorative Candle Holder Lantern for Table Center","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41NYDz-HKMS._AC_.jpg","description":"Add a gorgeous touch to any space with the graceful marriage of beauty & practicality eye-catching prop. Our decorative candle lanterns are made up of premium clay material that will pass the test of time. This vintage farmhouse decor candle lantern is designed in a cute barn shape. It would work wonderfully as a decorative centerpiece for a dining table or coffee table. Its vintage charm & inspiring quote will make your home warm & fuzzy. It makes a stunning display piece in your home & starts your day in a positive mood. Our lantern decor can be dressed up to an amazing decor with pot plants or succulents inside. By day, these barns add stunning sophistication to your home. Features that we love; Durable Clay Material Unique Barn Shape DesignsPerfect Size to DisplaySturdy & Reliable DECORATE YOUR HOME WITH LIGHTS: Add a gorgeous touch anywhere, and brings charm and beauty to your home with our candle holder lantern. This vintage style indoor & outdoor lantern fits any style of home decor, such as rustic, farmhouse, modern, and beach. Our farmhouse decor candle holder lantern is not only sturdy but certain to get plenty of compliments. MULTIFUNCTIONAL CANDLE LANTERNS: Our decorative candle holder lanterns are perfect to work as table décor or standing decor. This house decor candle holder is great for wedding decoration, table centerpiece, fireplace mantle decor, entryway décor, or patio decor. AN IDEAL GIFT: These house decor tealight candle holder lanterns can be small but creative gifts for housewarming, birthdays, festivals, or other occasions. Surprise your loved ones with this vintage farmhouse decor lantern. Anyone who likes to decorate space with lights will love what Firstofakind has to offer. Dimensions: 7.5\" Barn Candle Lantern","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41NYDz-HKMS._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"First of a Kind","source_asin":"B095W47ZCP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-561577","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095W47ZCP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095W47ZCP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
