window.products.push({"id":561681,"name":"ZWYOQI 16 FT Fake Rose Vine Garland Artificial Flowers Plants Hanging Rose Ivy Home Hotel Office Wedding Party Garden Décor (White/2PCS)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61nXiqOucOL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"FEATURES 1.Artificial rose vine plant is a low-maintenance decoration for any nature-inspired space. 2.Exquisite color dyeing technology makes fake rose flowers and leaves distinctly vivid with clear texture. 3.The silk artificial rose flowers and leaves connect tightly to the plastic stem via injection molding technology, which are hard to fall off. 4.The artificial rose garland is washable, with foliage color hardly fading after high temperature ironing process. PRODUCT PARAMETERS 1. Package include：2pcs artificial rose vines. 2. Fake rose garland length: approx. 8 feet each garland, total length approx. 16 feet. 3. Artificial rose flowers and leaves size：204 leaves per vine. Leaves size: approx. 2.2 inch (5.5cm), flowers size: approx. 3.2 inch (8cm). 4. Fake rose garland material: Silk (waterproof, avoid soaking). 5. Artificial rose garland stem material: High strength plastic (support outdoor decoration). What scenario can artificial rose vine plants be used? 1. Wedding decoration: wedding arch, table, chair, garland, gate, etc. 2. Party decoration: background, light, cosplay, costume, baby birthday, baby shower etc. 3. Outdoor: patio, yard, wall, balcony, fence, garden, gate pillar, trellis, swing, farmhouse, rockery, curtain, etc. 4. Indoor: wall, bedroom, kitchen, staircase, bookshelf, window, door, ceiling, office, mirror, lamp, exhibition, etc. NOTE: 1.Artificial rose vines maybe case some plastic smell in the long time's package. Pls open and hang where the air convection in 1-2 days. The plastic smell it will go away normally. 2.This item size information is just for reference only, and allow 1-2in differences due to manual measurement. 3.Due to the difference between different monitors, the picture may not reflect the actual color of the item.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61nXiqOucOL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZWYOQI","source_asin":"B09Z7PSFLK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-561681","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Z7PSFLK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Z7PSFLK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
