window.products.push({"id":561695,"name":"Hallo Non-Slip Bathtub Mat Ultra Soft TPE Massage Bath Mat Bathroom Shower Mat, Machine Washable Bath Tub Mat for Bathroom '40×16-White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/516KqGWZYVL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Customer questions & answers Q:Will this mat work on textured surfaces?A:I doubt that it would work on textured surfaces. The on the bottom is a large number of suction cups that (I believe) require a smooth surface to adhere. We use it in a clawfoot tub w/shower conversion, and it works great. (If your surface is textured to begin with, you probably don't need the mat. The reason to have it is to guard against slipping). A:The description says that it can be cleaned in washing machine. Has anyone done this? If so, did you use a top loader or front loader machine?Q:I have washed it in a front loader. It came out clean. I do it about every 2-3 weeks.A:Is this for inside the Shower?Q:Yes,it is a perfect addition for hotels, bathtub,gyms, saunas, spas, and anywhere else you need a premium mat to hold up after many uses. 【PRODUCT DESCRIPTION】 INCLUDED:1 x Bathtub matSTANDARD SIZE:40X16 INSPECIFICATION:RectangleCOLOR:WhiteMATERIAL:High-Quality TPR 【HOW TO USE IT?】 1.Ensure the bottom of the bathtub is clean and smooth,it maybe does not work on textured surfaces well;2.Press down every cup to insure a perfect bond to the bottom of the tub;3.After bathing,rinse the bottom with water to prevent the accumulation of soap;4.Stick on the wall to drain,or hang it on the clip to air dry;5.If you need quick drainage, it is recommended to take out the mat; 【HOW TO CARE IT?】 1.Rinse mat with water to prevent soap build up;2.Do not expose the mat to direct sunlight for too long;3.Machine washable and periodical rinsing with detergent advisable;","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/516KqGWZYVL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hallo","source_asin":"B07V6QLSCM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-561695","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07V6QLSCM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07V6QLSCM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
